          Easily 720p me gaming kr skte ho;

--Coding  - VS code easily runs without Lag;

--Editing - 1080p editing  (Tried filmora);

--Battery - 2-3 hours backup;

--Ports   - All ports working

--TYPE C port also there for data transfer;

No Bill Box, Laptop and charger only;
Bought this from my brother year in december 2024 for my college;

But abhi mene gaming pc build krwaya h so no need of this laptop anymore


Note- only speaker ki sound km h
baki koi single issue nhi h aap check kr skte ho jitna chahe.

And keyboard replace krwana hoga aapko, some keys are automatically pressing

Address -rohini sec 22 delhi

